        "0": "--\n*  \n*   \n*  ( )\n*   ",
        "1": "...\n '    !'",
        "2": "\n !    !\n ?",
        "3": "  1:\n:  ? !\n: ...  !\n:  ?\n:     !",
        "4": "  ?\n ...   \n...\n \n  \n... ",
        "5": ":\n    ! ! ",
        "6": "''\n   !\n\n  \n \n\n* '' ! ",
        "7": "\n--\n... !\n . .  : ' '\n ... ",
        "8": " -- !\n\n?  '' !\n\n? ... !",
        "9": "--  --\n\n  \n...  \n 50    50  1  500 \n  50  .000016   !\n-. ",
        "10": "-~--~-\n   ... !\n...   ...  ...\n  \n   \n   \n '' \n  !\n...   !",
        "11": "\n 'Smoluanu'...  ''  ?\n  :\n \n...  \n  '?' ... \n  ...\n\n-. ",
        "12": "\n\n \n ...''\n\n \n\n\n \n\n !   \n 11  \n  \n",
        "13": "\n  ()\n   ''  \n   \n   ... !\n\n()",
        "14": "  2:\n:  \n: **... ... ... \n: ... '' ...     \n: ?\n: ...   ...    \n: ...? ... ...\n ......?\n:  \n\n****",
        "15": "!\n\n ''\n  !\n: ...\n ... !\n  ...  !\n '' ...  ",
        "16": "\n\n   \n\n \n\n ... \n\n \n\n\n\n\n\n  ''   \n\n   ",
